{"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"RawRepresentable Implementations","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"collectionGroup"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect\/init(from:)-3ocbg"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect\/hashValue"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect\/hash(into:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/permissioneffect\/rawrepresentable-implementations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect\/RawRepresentable-Implementations"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect"]]},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PermissionEffect":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PermissionEffect"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/permissioneffect","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether a grant permits an action or refuses it (B1, deny-override). # Precedence Default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deny -> an ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Allow"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant permits -> a ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Deny"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and beats every allow"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", wherever either sits in the resource hierarchy. Deny"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wins; there is no most-specific-wins tie-break. That choice is deliberate and is argued in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md"},{"type":"text","text":" §2.1. The short version: deny-override buys one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checkable property — "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"adding a deny rule can never widen access, and can never be undone by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adding allows","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — and most-specific-wins buys expressiveness at the cost of making “is X"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"denied?” unanswerable without enumerating every other rule that might out-specify it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Allow"},{"type":"text","text":"] is the default, so data written before this existed, and clients"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that send no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"effect"},{"type":"text","text":", both mean “allow”. No migration."}],"title":"PermissionEffect","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PermissionEffect"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PermissionEffect/hash(into:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/permissioneffect\/hash(into:)","abstract":[],"title":"hash(into:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"hash"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6HasherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hasher"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],